OL,3,GNEWSAPersistent fly-tipper fined for
OL,4,Ayear-long spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said during its investigation that
OL,7,Fshe "failed to communicate or engage
OL,8,Fwith the Environmental Crime Team",
OL,9,Fadding that fly-tipping was "totally
OL,10,Funacceptable".
